WEBVTT

01:36.400 --> 01:40.990
[The Journey of Legend]

01:41.330 --> 01:43.930
[Episode 32]

01:56.120 --> 01:56.920
Mr. Fei,

01:58.310 --> 01:59.440
is something wrong?

01:59.920 --> 02:02.180
If this is the real Thousand-Faces Mask,

02:02.420 --> 02:04.730
cut off from a living person for so long,

02:04.960 --> 02:07.150
without the Fei family's internal energy
to sustain it,

02:07.150 --> 02:09.610
it should've dissolved
into blood long ago.

02:09.870 --> 02:10.520
But look,

02:10.990 --> 02:12.640
the skin is still intact.

02:13.120 --> 02:14.470
It's clearly a fake.

02:15.200 --> 02:17.870
But how could that be?

02:20.030 --> 02:23.690
This object is connected
to a few major cases in the martial world.

02:23.710 --> 02:26.040
It's more than just your family's affair.

02:29.030 --> 02:30.090
My father's sword?

02:31.270 --> 02:33.829
Why is my father's sword in this coffin?

02:34.450 --> 02:37.410
Is my father the one buried here?

02:40.710 --> 02:41.520
Mr. Fei,

02:42.160 --> 02:43.390
just speak plainly.

02:44.280 --> 02:47.710
If word spreads
that the Thousand-Faces Mask still exists,

02:48.120 --> 02:49.750
it will cause a huge storm.

02:50.460 --> 02:52.320
When that happens, the Fei family

02:53.230 --> 02:54.760
will definitely be doomed.

02:55.680 --> 02:56.680
Five years ago,

02:57.240 --> 03:00.870
when Danfeng returned from his mission
for the Imperial City Division,

03:00.870 --> 03:02.960
he was hunted by Zhu the Great King.

03:03.560 --> 03:04.870
I rushed to his aid,

03:05.310 --> 03:08.630
but on the way, I encountered
Zhu the Great King's subordinate,

03:08.630 --> 03:09.750
Lord Roushui.

03:10.120 --> 03:13.150
I thought he was the one hunting Danfeng,

03:13.520 --> 03:17.520
so I used all my strength to kill him
with the Marrow-Disrupting Finger.

03:26.870 --> 03:28.520
But when I removed his mask,

03:29.000 --> 03:32.360
I discovered it was my own son, Danfeng.

03:32.760 --> 03:33.490
Danfeng!

03:35.220 --> 03:37.100
Danfeng!

03:38.460 --> 03:40.630
After that, I crippled my internal energy

03:40.630 --> 03:44.240
and vowed never
to use the Marrow-Disrupting Finger again.

03:46.570 --> 03:47.370
Grandfather,

03:47.590 --> 03:48.320
my father...

03:49.150 --> 03:50.760
was killed by you?

03:51.190 --> 03:53.280
Grandfather, give me back my father!

03:53.470 --> 03:54.829
-Young Master!
-Give me back my father!

03:54.829 --> 03:56.750
Grandfather, give me back my father!

03:56.750 --> 03:57.290
Let's go, Young Master!

03:57.290 --> 03:58.620
Give me back my father!

03:58.850 --> 03:59.970
Grandfather!

04:01.030 --> 04:02.280
Grandfather.

04:04.120 --> 04:05.050
Mr. Fei.

04:08.860 --> 04:12.390
What grudge did Zhu the Great King have
against Fei Danfeng?

04:13.010 --> 04:14.170
To be frank,

04:14.960 --> 04:17.550
the martial arts of the Fei family
were never top-tier

04:17.550 --> 04:19.550
among the Three Mystical Families.

04:19.990 --> 04:22.050
It was only
because of the Thousand-Faces Mask

04:22.050 --> 04:24.400
that we could establish ourselves
in the martial world.

04:24.400 --> 04:27.560
That day, Danfeng was following
the Imperial City Division's secret order

04:27.560 --> 04:30.520
to secretly investigate
Zhu the Great King's identity.

04:30.520 --> 04:33.810
He discovered
Constable Tieyi is Zhu the Great King.

04:34.490 --> 04:36.290
To get the Thousand-Faces Mask,

04:37.340 --> 04:39.460
he tricked me into killing Danfeng.

04:40.400 --> 04:42.930
Zhu the Great King is Constable Tieyi?

04:43.030 --> 04:44.460
Could it be he was the one
who fabricated the story

04:44.460 --> 04:46.290
that Baicao Valley colluded
with Northern Wasteland?

04:46.290 --> 04:48.690
If the Thousand-Faces Mask
is in his hands,

04:48.700 --> 04:50.760
the one who disguised himself as Chief

04:50.760 --> 04:53.390
and tricked me
into killing Tianzheng and Taichan

04:53.390 --> 04:54.510
must have been him.

04:57.380 --> 04:58.510
What's done is done.

04:59.010 --> 05:01.060
I'll say no more.

05:01.690 --> 05:02.640
Mr. Xiao,

05:03.320 --> 05:04.520
I hope in the future, you'll

05:04.520 --> 05:06.690
give an explanation
to everyone in the martial world.

05:06.690 --> 05:10.350
No matter what bloodshed
the Thousand-Faces Mask stirs up again,

05:10.520 --> 05:13.320
prove that the Fei family
has nothing to do with it.

05:15.360 --> 05:16.480
Please.

05:18.250 --> 05:20.250
Mr. Fei, no need for such formality.

06:09.500 --> 06:12.770
[Taiji Palace]

06:18.730 --> 06:19.520
Chief Li,

06:19.930 --> 06:20.990
it's getting late.

06:21.290 --> 06:22.130
Please.

06:48.000 --> 06:52.250
[Daxi's emperor]

07:31.000 --> 07:31.730
I, Chenzhou,

07:33.080 --> 07:34.810
pay my respect to Your Majesty.

07:34.850 --> 07:35.520
Chenzhou.

07:36.490 --> 07:37.820
Chenzhou, you're here.

07:39.620 --> 07:40.520
Long time no see,

07:40.520 --> 07:42.290
and you're still as impressive as ever.

07:42.290 --> 07:42.820
I thought

07:42.820 --> 07:44.930
you didn't want to drink with me anymore.

07:44.930 --> 07:45.810
Come. Hurry.

07:46.000 --> 07:47.330
Join me for a few drinks.

07:48.400 --> 07:49.400
Sit down quickly.

07:50.050 --> 07:50.640
Look,

07:50.670 --> 07:52.000
I'm thoughtful, right?

07:52.130 --> 07:54.090
The dishes I prepared
are all your favorites.

07:54.090 --> 07:54.480
Here.

07:54.810 --> 07:55.330
Hurry.

07:57.680 --> 07:58.090
Eat.

08:00.930 --> 08:02.640
The waterway transport was tedious.

08:02.640 --> 08:05.100
I only reached the capital
after nightfall.

08:05.200 --> 08:06.660
Sorry for disturbing you.

08:08.760 --> 08:10.220
After all this time apart,

08:10.520 --> 08:12.050
you're still so impatient.

08:12.440 --> 08:12.930
Fine.

08:13.370 --> 08:15.370
Let's discuss business first.

08:16.620 --> 08:19.380
[Memorial]

08:18.490 --> 08:19.100
Look.

08:19.690 --> 08:20.880
This memorial states

08:20.880 --> 08:22.880
a censor has accused your Power Gang

08:23.170 --> 08:25.560
of misappropriating treasury assets

08:25.690 --> 08:27.490
and distributing them
to various sects in the martial world.

08:27.490 --> 08:29.350
It states the Power Gang took 90%,

08:29.450 --> 08:32.179
and the other sects in the martial world
took 10%.

08:33.880 --> 08:34.760
Is that true?

08:45.810 --> 08:47.270
I am guilty, Your Majesty.

08:47.850 --> 08:49.450
Winter has come in the north,

08:49.780 --> 08:51.760
and the soldiers lacked food and clothing.

08:51.760 --> 08:52.820
I couldn't bear it.

08:53.110 --> 08:55.770
So I sent 90% of the treasures
to the front lines.

08:57.000 --> 08:58.450
The war situation was critical

08:58.450 --> 08:59.910
and could change rapidly,

09:00.610 --> 09:02.610
so I didn't report this matter.

09:03.400 --> 09:06.130
In this matter,
I indeed overstepped the bounds.

09:06.490 --> 09:08.290
I willingly accept punishment.

09:13.160 --> 09:14.220
I see what you mean.

09:15.130 --> 09:16.520
You mean

09:16.920 --> 09:19.250
I was thoughtless

09:19.880 --> 09:21.480
and neglected the soldiers.

09:26.330 --> 09:27.590
Since that's the case,

09:28.590 --> 09:30.190
there's nothing more to say.

09:30.610 --> 09:31.280
Chenzhou,

09:32.490 --> 09:33.690
drink this cup of wine

09:35.020 --> 09:36.060
and you may leave.

11:51.490 --> 11:52.130
Chenzhou.

11:54.090 --> 11:55.430
I'll go get you an imperial physician.

11:55.430 --> 11:56.100
No need.

11:59.060 --> 12:01.260
I knew about the memorial of accusation,

12:01.260 --> 12:02.260
so I rushed here.

12:03.520 --> 12:04.330
Actually,

12:04.730 --> 12:06.860
you didn't need to come here yourself.

12:07.680 --> 12:08.920
Perhaps His Majesty wouldn't have...

12:08.920 --> 12:09.720
Prince Liang,

12:12.130 --> 12:13.590
do you think the snow falls

12:14.210 --> 12:16.290
because of a single day's cold?

12:23.630 --> 12:24.670
I always thought

12:25.370 --> 12:28.570
you angrily left the court
and wandered the martial world

12:29.090 --> 12:32.240
because you were dissatisfied
with many of the court's policies.

12:32.240 --> 12:33.330
As a prince,

12:33.830 --> 12:36.430
I'm inevitably burdened
by the state affairs,

12:36.610 --> 12:39.870
constrained
within these uncomfortable official robes.

12:45.290 --> 12:47.160
Now, seeing you risking your life
to remonstrate,

12:47.160 --> 12:49.490
I finally understand why you did all that.

12:50.920 --> 12:53.450
Now I know
my past judgments were prejudiced.

12:54.520 --> 12:55.610
I'm so sorry.

12:58.400 --> 12:59.880
Throughout my life,

13:02.370 --> 13:05.000
my actions have been like
a wild goose treading on snow.

13:05.000 --> 13:06.680
What others think of me

13:07.610 --> 13:08.740
doesn't matter to me

13:09.920 --> 13:11.210
at all.

13:12.760 --> 13:13.890
Hearing you say that

13:15.100 --> 13:16.360
reminds me of someone.

13:18.250 --> 13:21.130
But when the wild goose flies away,
who'd care if it goes east or west?

13:21.130 --> 13:22.400
If one day you're gone,

13:23.490 --> 13:24.550
in this vast world,

13:25.090 --> 13:27.890
who can accomplish the tasks
you left unfinished?

13:32.920 --> 13:33.720
Your Majesty,

13:34.680 --> 13:35.810
after the Power Gang

13:35.970 --> 13:38.080
took the treasures from the Nantian Abyss,

13:38.080 --> 13:41.090
they indeed converted them into supplies
and sent them to the front lines.

13:41.090 --> 13:42.610
Trying to buy loyalty?

13:44.080 --> 13:45.410
Did you find the object?

13:46.330 --> 13:49.060
The men I sent
were outmaneuvered by Li Chenzhou.

13:49.770 --> 13:52.500
The Royal Seal was not found
at the Nantian Abyss.

13:56.000 --> 13:57.040
Your Majesty, please calm your anger.

13:57.040 --> 13:58.040
Please punish me.

13:58.690 --> 14:00.330
Chenzhou's little schemes

14:01.250 --> 14:02.980
won't stay hidden much longer.

14:03.250 --> 14:05.250
Now that he's afflicted
with that severe poison,

14:05.250 --> 14:07.370
he has to come to me every month

14:07.760 --> 14:09.920
to beg for the antidote to stay alive.

14:10.410 --> 14:13.050
I'd like to see how tough he is

14:13.490 --> 14:15.020
and how long he can hold out.

14:15.730 --> 14:17.260
Your Majesty, you're wise.

14:17.610 --> 14:19.640
With your support, the waterways

14:20.160 --> 14:21.570
already possess the capability

14:21.570 --> 14:24.030
to rival the Power Gang
in the martial world.

14:24.330 --> 14:26.060
It won't be easy for Li Chenzhou

14:26.160 --> 14:27.250
to cause trouble.

14:29.880 --> 14:31.010
Enough, Constable.

14:32.040 --> 14:32.880
Rise.

14:33.610 --> 14:35.010
Thank you, Your Majesty.

14:35.610 --> 14:37.980
Daxi and Northern Wasteland
have seen incessant wars these years.

14:37.980 --> 14:40.040
The people have suffered immensely.

14:40.640 --> 14:42.240
It weighs heavily on my mind.

14:42.680 --> 14:44.730
Li Chenzhou has toiled for so many years.

14:44.730 --> 14:46.330
It's time for him to rest now.

14:46.400 --> 14:47.160
From now on,

14:47.160 --> 14:49.960
the martial world of Daxi
will be entrusted to you.

14:50.410 --> 14:53.120
Do not disappoint me again.

14:54.850 --> 14:56.910
I will serve with utmost dedication.

15:22.590 --> 15:24.710
I saw what you did at the Fei family.

15:26.920 --> 15:28.520
You said in front of everyone

15:28.650 --> 15:30.980
you despise bullying the weak most of all.

15:31.490 --> 15:32.370
Xiao Qiushui,

15:32.880 --> 15:34.410
I want to ask you for a favor.

15:34.840 --> 15:37.000
Will you help me or not?

15:39.110 --> 15:40.570
You've been following me.

15:41.400 --> 15:43.330
Do you know about the calamity
that befell the Xiao family?

15:43.330 --> 15:46.330
I don't know who harmed your family,

15:46.850 --> 15:47.910
but I know the truth

15:48.330 --> 15:51.160
about what Danfeng was investigating
back then.

16:05.450 --> 16:07.780
You want to use that
as payment for my help?

16:08.520 --> 16:11.570
Fei Yuqiao, Master of the Fei family.

16:21.640 --> 16:23.370
I should have died long ago.

16:23.920 --> 16:25.090
But I am unwilling.

16:26.610 --> 16:27.680
Look at my face.

16:28.400 --> 16:31.660
This is the consequence
of using the Thousand-Faces Mask.

16:32.680 --> 16:34.540
So using the Thousand-Faces Mask

16:35.280 --> 16:36.210
for a long time

16:39.240 --> 16:40.700
actually results in this.

16:44.160 --> 16:45.250
That's not all.

16:46.080 --> 16:47.920
Every time the mask is used,

16:48.610 --> 16:51.070
it greatly depletes one's internal energy.

16:51.280 --> 16:52.680
With the slightest carelessness,

16:52.680 --> 16:54.140
one's life will be at risk.

16:54.680 --> 16:56.880
The Fei family established its place
in the martial world

16:56.880 --> 16:58.940
because of the Thousand-Faces Mask,

17:00.250 --> 17:01.850
yet was also destroyed by it.

17:01.920 --> 17:04.520
Everyone in the martial world
covets the mask.

17:05.329 --> 17:06.990
Look at the Fei family.

17:07.089 --> 17:07.849
For its sake,

17:09.050 --> 17:10.849
we fought to the death.

17:12.079 --> 17:16.190
Back then, I removed the mask
and went into seclusion while I was weak.

17:16.920 --> 17:18.720
But I was betrayed by my servant,

17:19.339 --> 17:23.030
becoming a wandering ghost.

17:24.480 --> 17:28.160
So you want me to help you
reclaim the mask?

17:29.000 --> 17:29.830
No.

17:32.050 --> 17:34.480
The Thousand-Faces Mask
is now adrift in the martial world.

17:34.480 --> 17:36.280
It could cause widespread harm.

17:36.640 --> 17:37.920
I just want to find it

17:38.480 --> 17:40.010
and destroy it completely.

17:40.920 --> 17:42.440
Why do you trust me?

17:46.160 --> 17:47.810
Being a ghost for so long

17:48.130 --> 17:50.240
has made me see people more clearly.

17:51.640 --> 17:52.530
Xiao Qiushui,

17:53.400 --> 17:56.090
I'm sorry about your parents' death.

17:56.610 --> 17:58.010
Though we weren't close,

17:58.050 --> 18:00.990
your father was the hero I admired most.

18:01.720 --> 18:02.580
Let me tell you,

18:03.480 --> 18:05.880
the person who hunted Danfeng back then

18:06.440 --> 18:08.770
also used the Marrow-Disrupting Finger.

18:09.810 --> 18:10.870
Zhu the Great King?

18:11.400 --> 18:12.130
Correct.

18:12.880 --> 18:16.200
I transcribed the technique into a manual

18:16.720 --> 18:18.680
and lent it to Constable Tieyi.

18:19.610 --> 18:21.640
He must have memorized it then.

18:22.640 --> 18:24.090
Find Constable Tieyi

18:24.570 --> 18:27.330
and destroy the Thousand-Faces Mask
in his possession.

18:27.330 --> 18:28.660
The Fei family's object

18:29.130 --> 18:33.090
must not be allowed to create
more scumbags in the martial world.

18:34.680 --> 18:35.480
Mr. Xiao.

18:37.480 --> 18:38.480
Mr. Xiao,

18:39.480 --> 18:40.570
please!

18:41.720 --> 18:42.370
Sir.

18:47.280 --> 18:48.120
Thank you.

19:04.670 --> 19:05.870
I finally found you.

19:06.530 --> 19:08.160
This is your retribution!

19:08.640 --> 19:09.160
Tell me,

19:09.720 --> 19:10.810
how to cure it?

19:11.360 --> 19:13.290
My face is your future!

19:13.720 --> 19:16.090
No one can cure
the Thousand-Faces Mask's backlash!

19:16.090 --> 19:19.690
The martial world has one more monster,
neither human nor ghost!

19:34.560 --> 19:41.430
[Song Residence]

19:48.960 --> 19:53.310
[Unbridled and Clear]

20:30.610 --> 20:31.680
It's you.

20:35.090 --> 20:36.050
Xiao Yiren,

20:36.660 --> 20:38.120
I've been waiting for you.

20:46.960 --> 20:50.920
Aren't the Long River waterways enough
for you to occupy and enrich yourself?

20:50.920 --> 20:53.090
You've actually colluded
with Northern Wastelanders.

20:53.090 --> 20:54.550
What exactly are you up to?

20:56.920 --> 20:57.770
Colluding?

20:58.740 --> 20:59.800
Enriching myself?

21:01.770 --> 21:03.160
I'm not that shallow.

21:04.090 --> 21:04.610
Look.

21:05.160 --> 21:06.360
At the Nantian Abyss,

21:06.480 --> 21:09.010
did I ever ask you
to seize a single coin for me?

21:12.720 --> 21:15.050
Li Chenzhou is the one enriching himself.

21:19.720 --> 21:22.330
He converted half of the treasures
at the Nantian Abyss into supplies

21:22.330 --> 21:24.130
and sent them to the front lines.

21:24.960 --> 21:28.240
But that's not what His Majesty
wants to see.

21:29.960 --> 21:31.680
As I told you last time,

21:33.040 --> 21:36.240
if the war between Daxi
and Northern Wasteland continues,

21:36.240 --> 21:38.200
it will exhaust our people and resources.

21:38.200 --> 21:41.260
No matter how much treasure we have,
it only fills holes

21:42.050 --> 21:43.910
and disappears with each battle.

21:45.090 --> 21:47.690
I'm just trying
to ease His Majesty's burdens.

21:48.290 --> 21:49.750
If that's really the case,

21:50.400 --> 21:52.530
why didn't you tell me clearly before?

21:53.920 --> 21:55.220
You tricked me into going
to the Nantian Abyss

21:55.220 --> 21:56.620
and made me lose all face.

21:57.290 --> 21:59.610
The Xiao family's reputation
built over generations

21:59.610 --> 22:00.880
has been ruined!

22:03.480 --> 22:04.680
I would ruin anything

22:05.130 --> 22:07.390
but never the Xiao family's reputation.

22:09.720 --> 22:10.920
You don't believe me?

22:12.110 --> 22:14.030
[Loyalty and Righteousness of Jinzhong]

22:23.570 --> 22:26.240
His Majesty heard of your desire
to serve the court,

22:26.240 --> 22:29.400
so he personally wrote 4 characters
as a gift to your family.

22:29.400 --> 22:30.860
With this imperial edict,

22:31.090 --> 22:32.620
the Xiao family's prestige

22:32.880 --> 22:35.810
will likely surpass
even that of Shaolin and Wudang.

22:41.290 --> 22:43.400
Now His Majesty needs loyal men.

22:44.240 --> 22:45.130
Serve well,

22:46.330 --> 22:48.660
and you will bring glory to your ancestors

22:49.160 --> 22:50.240
in no time.

22:51.330 --> 22:52.330
Isn't that right?

23:01.480 --> 23:02.010
Go.

23:02.640 --> 23:05.050
Go eliminate someone for His Majesty.

23:10.810 --> 23:12.050
You just need to wait.

23:12.720 --> 23:13.770
When needed,

23:14.090 --> 23:15.370
I will come to you.

23:36.370 --> 23:43.650
[Xiao Residence]

23:45.130 --> 23:46.850
-Thank you, Your Majesty.
-Thank you, Your Majesty.

23:46.850 --> 23:50.570
-Long live the emperor!
-Long live the emperor!

23:50.880 --> 23:51.810
Rise.

23:57.330 --> 24:01.260
Congratulations, Mr. Xiao,
on proving worthy of His Majesty's favor.

24:01.480 --> 24:03.570
We're leaving now.

24:17.920 --> 24:18.570
Yiren.

24:19.920 --> 24:20.640
Xiaoyi.

24:22.480 --> 24:23.130
Look.

24:23.790 --> 24:26.850
This is the plaque
personally bestowed by His Majesty:

24:26.880 --> 24:28.730
Loyalty and Righteousness of Jinzhong.

24:28.730 --> 24:31.400
When has our family ever had such honor?

24:31.620 --> 24:33.720
It was personally bestowed by His Majesty?

24:33.720 --> 24:34.960
That's wonderful.

24:39.480 --> 24:40.740
You guys may leave now.

24:41.010 --> 24:41.730
-Yes.
-Yes.

24:46.130 --> 24:46.720
Yiren,

24:47.050 --> 24:50.050
I assume the Nantian Abyss matter
has been cleared up?

24:50.480 --> 24:52.540
Regarding the Nantian Abyss matter,

24:52.720 --> 24:55.780
I will make the whole world understand
sooner or later.

24:59.640 --> 25:00.160
Yiren,

25:00.920 --> 25:03.370
I don't mean to dampen your spirits.

25:04.400 --> 25:06.720
It's just the more I think about it,

25:07.090 --> 25:09.130
the more strange
the plaque's bestowal seems.

25:09.130 --> 25:10.960
The Northern Wastelanders
haven't been found,

25:10.960 --> 25:13.360
and your reputation hasn't been restored.

25:13.480 --> 25:16.410
So why would His Majesty
personally bestow a plaque?

25:16.920 --> 25:18.250
What do you mean by that?

25:19.440 --> 25:21.050
Are you suggesting that the Xiao family

25:21.050 --> 25:22.920
isn't worthy of an imperial plaque?

25:22.920 --> 25:24.090
Or the Xiao family

25:24.480 --> 25:27.160
doesn't deserve the title
"Loyalty and Righteousness of Jinzhong"?

25:27.160 --> 25:29.920
You kept saying
you'd help me restore the Xiao family.

25:29.920 --> 25:31.640
But now that I've done it,

25:32.480 --> 25:34.140
why are you so uncomfortable?

25:34.480 --> 25:36.210
Yiren, that's not what I meant.

25:36.240 --> 25:37.920
Of course I'm happy for you.

25:38.960 --> 25:40.690
It's just I feel that this place

25:41.050 --> 25:42.370
seems bustling now,

25:43.330 --> 25:44.590
but it's just a facade.

25:45.240 --> 25:46.440
It completely lacks the imposing spirit

25:46.440 --> 25:48.050
Huanhua Sect had at its peak.

25:48.880 --> 25:49.610
It seems...

25:51.240 --> 25:53.480
people's hearts aren't here.

25:53.960 --> 25:55.560
Then where are their hearts?

25:55.720 --> 25:56.400
Are they

25:56.720 --> 25:59.250
with Qiushui's Shenzhou Sworn Brotherhood?

25:59.400 --> 26:01.640
Now that I have His Majesty's favor,

26:03.090 --> 26:04.950
they will submit sooner or later.

26:05.330 --> 26:07.530
I'll let you see Huanhua grow stronger.

26:13.960 --> 26:14.850
Xiao Qiushui,

26:15.640 --> 26:17.960
why must you ruin my plans
wherever you are?

26:15.760 --> 26:19.770
[Fei Yuqiao]

26:18.920 --> 26:21.200
Things have come this far now.

26:22.440 --> 26:25.240
No one will be able to hinder me anymore.

26:33.440 --> 26:38.220
[Vast as Sea]

26:35.450 --> 26:36.110
Delicious.

26:36.690 --> 26:37.210
Good.

26:39.330 --> 26:39.860
Hey! Hey!

26:39.920 --> 26:40.610
What are you doing?

26:40.610 --> 26:41.610
There's plenty more!

26:41.610 --> 26:42.810
Why are you grabbing?

26:43.610 --> 26:45.270
There's enough for everyone.

26:46.330 --> 26:46.990
Fifth Thug!

26:47.530 --> 26:48.640
Fifth Thug! Fifth Thug!

26:48.640 --> 26:49.640
Fifth Thug!

26:52.720 --> 26:54.530
Fifth Thug! Fifth Thug!

26:54.530 --> 26:55.720
You're finally back, Fifth Thug!

26:55.720 --> 26:56.380
Fifth Thug.

26:56.960 --> 26:57.440
Eat.

26:58.610 --> 26:59.530
You have some more.

26:59.530 --> 27:00.290
I want it. I want it.

27:00.290 --> 27:01.330
Give it to me. Give it to me.

27:01.330 --> 27:02.060
Give it to me.

27:03.850 --> 27:04.510
Fifth Thug.

27:07.040 --> 27:09.390
You came here for treatment, right?

27:10.720 --> 27:11.480
-Yes.
-Yes.

27:12.050 --> 27:12.780
Originally,

27:12.810 --> 27:14.740
our arms and legs fixed by Miss Tang

27:14.850 --> 27:17.180
just didn't work properly occasionally.

27:17.720 --> 27:18.920
You did that on purpose!

27:18.920 --> 27:20.480
Gradually, we've gotten used to it.

27:20.480 --> 27:23.610
But it's inconvenient for us
to travel in the martial world.

27:23.610 --> 27:24.470
You once told us

27:24.920 --> 27:26.850
that Xueyu is kind-hearted

27:27.160 --> 27:28.130
and skilled in medicine,

27:28.130 --> 27:29.370
and she can cure us.

27:29.920 --> 27:31.480
We came to look for her before

27:31.480 --> 27:32.740
but couldn't find her.

27:32.850 --> 27:34.480
So we came again today.

27:37.330 --> 27:39.640
But right now, she is at the medicine hut.

27:40.050 --> 27:42.110
I also came here looking for someone.

27:43.130 --> 27:46.130
Your issues seem
to be with your joints and meridians.

27:46.640 --> 27:47.230
How about this?

27:47.230 --> 27:48.320
I have a good friend

27:48.810 --> 27:49.810
at Biechuan Temple.

27:49.810 --> 27:51.090
He's called Grand Master Dayin.

27:51.090 --> 27:51.880
Go to him.

27:52.130 --> 27:54.390
Tell him you're Xiao Qiushui's friends.

27:54.850 --> 27:56.130
-Okay.
-Okay.

27:56.280 --> 27:56.850
That's great.

27:56.850 --> 27:57.920
Since you're already here,

27:57.920 --> 27:58.960
go in and have a seat.

27:58.960 --> 28:00.420
-Sure.
-That sounds good!

28:00.610 --> 28:01.920
-Let's go in and have a seat.
-Sounds great.

28:01.920 --> 28:03.610
Fifth Thug, your house is so big.

28:03.610 --> 28:04.810
-Do you have anything tasty?
-It's so spacious in there.

28:04.810 --> 28:05.330
That's right.

28:05.330 --> 28:05.960
We want something delicious.

28:05.960 --> 28:07.240
Yes, of course.

28:07.720 --> 28:09.850
How has everyone been lately?

28:10.130 --> 28:10.920
Pretty good.

28:10.920 --> 28:11.650
Pretty good.

28:11.810 --> 28:14.010
We saw a murder on our way here last time.

28:14.160 --> 28:14.960
That's right.

28:15.290 --> 28:16.160
Someone was murdered.

28:16.160 --> 28:18.160
It was that damned Constable Tieyi.

28:18.530 --> 28:19.850
-Yes.
-I had wanted to kill him for ages.

28:19.850 --> 28:21.530
He was pushed off a cliff by someone.

28:21.530 --> 28:22.530
Constable Tieyi?

28:23.160 --> 28:23.850
That's right.

28:23.850 --> 28:24.680
Yes, yes.

28:24.680 --> 28:26.130
Yes, it was him.

28:26.680 --> 28:27.480
That old jerk.

28:27.810 --> 28:29.610
I had wanted to kill him for ages.

28:30.480 --> 28:31.210
Second Thug,

28:31.440 --> 28:33.920
you were talking about Constable Tieyi
from Liushan Sect?

28:33.920 --> 28:34.530
Yes.

28:34.530 --> 28:34.910
It was him.

28:34.910 --> 28:36.040
It was that old jerk.

28:37.130 --> 28:37.920
Then tell me,

28:38.400 --> 28:39.260
what happened?

28:41.050 --> 28:42.250
After we parted ways,

28:42.250 --> 28:44.160
we felt the inconvenience
of our arms and legs for the first time.

28:44.160 --> 28:45.920
So we wanted to come to Xueyu for help.

28:45.920 --> 28:47.120
On the mountain path,

28:47.330 --> 28:48.590
we saw a person in black

28:48.850 --> 28:50.980
push Constable Tieyi off the cliff.

28:57.440 --> 28:58.850
Mur... Mur...

29:24.680 --> 29:26.810
I never expected you to be so ruthless.

29:27.130 --> 29:28.590
You killed so many people.

29:34.530 --> 29:35.480
Are you sure

29:36.400 --> 29:38.050
it was really Constable Tieyi you saw?

29:38.050 --> 29:40.330
-Yes.
-Yes, how could we be wrong?

29:40.440 --> 29:42.090
-We couldn't possibly be wrong.
-Even if my eyes blurred,

29:42.090 --> 29:43.330
we had 8 eyes in total.

29:43.330 --> 29:44.090
Right, 8 eyes.

29:44.090 --> 29:44.920
We couldn't all be wrong.

29:44.920 --> 29:45.640
Exactly.

29:45.680 --> 29:46.850
We had played cat and mouse
with that old fox

29:46.850 --> 29:48.160
-for so many years.
-So many years.

29:48.160 --> 29:49.810
We'd recognize him
even if he turned into ashes.

29:49.810 --> 29:51.130
Yes. Second Thug is right.

29:51.130 --> 29:52.640
Fifth Thug, if you don't believe us,

29:52.640 --> 29:53.850
I-I'll take you there to see for yourself.

29:53.850 --> 29:54.920
-It's right at the bottom of that cliff.
-Yes.

29:54.920 --> 29:55.960
The body might still be there.

29:55.960 --> 29:56.440
That's right.

29:56.440 --> 29:57.370
It must be there.

29:58.290 --> 29:58.820
Let's go.

29:59.240 --> 30:00.330
Let's go take a look.

30:00.330 --> 30:01.850
Let's go.

30:02.330 --> 30:04.190
-Let's go.
-We're not having tea?

30:06.680 --> 30:09.340
-Fifth Thug, over here.
-Fifth Thug, over here.

30:34.880 --> 30:37.050
He did know
how to use the Marrow-Disrupting Finger.

30:37.050 --> 30:39.250
It seems Constable Tieyi is truly dead.

30:44.980 --> 30:47.610
Then the current Zhu the Great King
in the martial world

30:47.610 --> 30:50.940
must be the killer disguised
with the Thousand-Faces Mask.

30:53.720 --> 30:54.400
Four Thugs.

30:55.480 --> 30:56.740
Before he died, he said

30:56.920 --> 30:58.680
that person in black killed many people?

30:58.680 --> 31:00.290
-Yes.
-That's right.

31:00.290 --> 31:01.420
This place is humid.

31:01.810 --> 31:03.160
Even if the body was exposed for months,

31:03.160 --> 31:04.290
it shouldn't be this shriveled.

31:04.290 --> 31:06.810
In the novel, the Asura Seal technique
in the Voidheart Codex

31:06.810 --> 31:08.480
seems to be able to absorb others' power,

31:08.480 --> 31:10.810
leaving the victims as dried-up corpses.

31:11.160 --> 31:13.290
What martial art could do such a thing?

31:13.720 --> 31:15.500
Could it be the Voidheart Codex?

31:15.500 --> 31:18.430
-The... The Voidheart Codex?
-The Voidheart Codex?

31:18.660 --> 31:20.120
Did I overlook something?

31:29.850 --> 31:30.510
Four Thugs.

31:31.020 --> 31:31.630
Listen,

31:32.130 --> 31:34.480
go quickly
and find Zhu the Great King's lair.

31:34.480 --> 31:35.580
-No problem.
-Okay.

31:35.580 --> 31:36.510
-Okay.
-Okay.

31:39.160 --> 31:41.620
[Xiao Residence]

31:52.770 --> 31:54.400
Someone secretly practiced
the Voidheart Codex carved in Sword Manor

31:54.400 --> 31:55.720
and then destroyed it.

31:56.480 --> 31:57.280
Could it be...

31:58.090 --> 31:59.240
someone had been lurking

31:59.240 --> 32:01.170
in Sword Manor just like Zhu Xiawu?

32:02.610 --> 32:03.680
Li Chenzhou said

32:04.610 --> 32:06.540
when Liu Suifeng arrived that day,

32:07.160 --> 32:10.020
Sword Manor had already been breached
from within.

32:12.240 --> 32:13.900
Sword Manor was impregnable.

32:14.480 --> 32:16.080
Breaking in from the outside

32:17.920 --> 32:19.200
was nothing easy.

32:20.810 --> 32:21.540
Big Brother,

32:21.620 --> 32:23.640
when Yuhan and I led people
to collect the bodies,

32:23.640 --> 32:25.400
we already discovered that the Qianji Lock
at the back of Sword Manor

32:25.400 --> 32:26.330
had been opened.

32:35.970 --> 32:40.010
Huanhua's Qianji Lock is very intricate

32:40.810 --> 32:42.740
and extremely difficult to break.

32:50.290 --> 32:52.090
Though the Qianji Lock is small,

32:52.640 --> 32:55.720
it contains 2 mechanisms.

32:56.050 --> 32:57.090
Two mechanisms?

32:58.880 --> 33:01.680
It's completely different
from any lock you've seen.

33:01.680 --> 33:03.960
To open it, it requires

33:05.090 --> 33:10.090
simultaneous action
from both inside and outside.

33:12.280 --> 33:13.680
Both inside and outside?

33:14.810 --> 33:16.210
Both inside and outside?

33:20.960 --> 33:22.240
Only someone

33:23.130 --> 33:25.590
who understands the Qianji Lock
can open it.

33:25.610 --> 33:26.530
He killed everyone,

33:26.530 --> 33:27.920
took the Thousand-Faces Mask,

33:27.920 --> 33:30.350
and disguised himself
as Zhu the Great King.

33:30.350 --> 33:31.680
Only Father, Mother, and my 2 brothers

33:31.680 --> 33:33.140
know how to open that lock.

33:34.130 --> 33:34.860
Impossible.

33:36.160 --> 33:36.800
Yiren and Kaiyan

33:36.800 --> 33:39.000
both arrived at Sword Manor after I did.

33:39.240 --> 33:39.970
Impossible.

33:40.680 --> 33:41.810
This is impossible.

33:58.880 --> 33:59.610
Big Brother,

34:00.090 --> 34:02.240
you've already done everything you could.

34:02.240 --> 34:03.970
Don't blame yourself anymore.

34:04.290 --> 34:07.530
That day, your brother Kaiyan
went ahead to scout the path.

34:07.530 --> 34:09.610
He returned
saying the road ahead was blocked.

34:09.610 --> 34:10.870
With no other options,

34:10.969 --> 34:12.429
Yiren had to take a detour,

34:13.050 --> 34:14.850
which delayed us considerably.

34:17.199 --> 34:18.280
Then how did Kaiyan

34:19.639 --> 34:20.889
get back?

34:21.570 --> 34:23.090
After he got separated from us,

34:23.090 --> 34:24.719
he fought his way through all obstacles

34:24.719 --> 34:26.179
to get back to Sword Manor.

34:27.050 --> 34:27.840
It was you.

34:31.130 --> 34:31.800
Qiushui.

34:33.969 --> 34:35.239
I went to buy osmanthus cakes.

34:35.239 --> 34:36.900
I heard they say you came back,

34:37.090 --> 34:38.889
so I specially brought you some.

34:42.800 --> 34:43.530
Xiaoyi,

34:44.840 --> 34:46.170
are Yiren and Kaiyan...

34:47.409 --> 34:48.719
in Xiao Villa now?

34:49.949 --> 34:51.199
Yiren has a meeting with someone

34:51.199 --> 34:52.239
and isn't in the villa.

34:52.239 --> 34:55.239
Kaiyan seems to have gone to Pipa Pavilion
for drinks.

34:55.449 --> 34:56.090
Xiaoyi.

34:58.050 --> 34:58.850
What's wrong?

35:01.930 --> 35:02.610
Nothing.

35:35.790 --> 35:37.180
[Winning over Luzhou's governor
by offering him power and a high position]

35:37.210 --> 35:39.920
[Some of our elite soldiers
have infiltrated merchant caravans]

35:42.730 --> 35:43.600
[Investigate
the military deployments at Qiliang Pass]

35:43.600 --> 35:44.480
[It is crucial to our subsequent plans]

36:49.450 --> 36:50.280
Qiushui?

36:51.800 --> 36:53.000
What brings you here?

37:06.530 --> 37:09.390
Today, I happened
to have prepared a table of dishes

37:10.130 --> 37:12.330
our parents loved when they were alive.

37:14.450 --> 37:15.650
You're in for a treat.

37:31.330 --> 37:32.120
Try some.

37:41.190 --> 37:42.320
Mother always loved

37:44.640 --> 37:46.300
brewing tea for us in the past.

37:47.280 --> 37:48.050
At that time,

37:49.570 --> 37:51.770
she loved making all kinds of pastries.

37:56.490 --> 37:57.490
In those days,

38:00.280 --> 38:02.740
I always thought
I could enjoy them forever.

38:07.240 --> 38:08.170
Unfortunately,

38:10.930 --> 38:12.050
Mother's cooking

38:16.530 --> 38:18.660
is something we can never taste again.

38:30.130 --> 38:31.490
Why bring this up?

38:33.410 --> 38:34.680
Why talk

38:36.490 --> 38:37.750
about such sad things?

38:46.240 --> 38:47.240
Father and Mother

38:48.200 --> 38:50.000
died so unjustly and unclearly.

38:52.410 --> 38:53.090
Kaiyan,

38:55.410 --> 38:56.890
I still can't figure out

39:01.470 --> 39:02.740
who

39:06.410 --> 39:07.890
could hate them so much.

39:24.890 --> 39:26.280
Life is unpredictable.

39:28.930 --> 39:30.320
Nothing is certain.

40:11.730 --> 40:13.460
Then just reset.

40:13.980 --> 40:14.770
Reset

40:15.010 --> 40:16.970
and buff the character
with more golden cheats.

40:16.970 --> 40:17.840
You're R.

40:19.050 --> 40:21.970
You're quite clever.

40:22.970 --> 40:23.610
R.

40:24.090 --> 40:26.280
Li Nan, it really is you.

40:27.120 --> 40:28.570
Xiao Kaiyan.

40:52.280 --> 40:53.490
What is this about?

41:00.240 --> 41:01.840
Why have your martial skills

41:02.450 --> 41:03.890
improved so much?

41:04.570 --> 41:05.360
Qiushui,

41:07.350 --> 41:09.970
are you the only one allowed
to have fortuitous encounters?

41:09.970 --> 41:11.570
Am I not allowed to work hard?

41:12.390 --> 41:13.430
Then tell me,

41:15.570 --> 41:16.650
when did you

41:18.490 --> 41:21.220
learn these unorthodox techniques
from others?

41:22.930 --> 41:24.390
Is it the Voidheart Codex?

41:33.980 --> 41:36.710
I don't know
what nonsense you're talking about.

41:43.280 --> 41:44.280
Stop pretending.

41:45.090 --> 41:47.420
The method to open Huanhua's Qianji Lock—

41:48.900 --> 41:50.650
Father only told us 3 brothers.

41:57.280 --> 41:58.680
You're still quibbling!

42:22.530 --> 42:23.460
Who's out there?

42:24.130 --> 42:24.640
Father!

42:25.280 --> 42:26.210
It's me, Kaiyan!

42:27.280 --> 42:28.090
It's Kaiyan.

42:37.930 --> 42:39.720
You returned to Sword Manor in advance

42:39.720 --> 42:42.250
and secretly practiced
the Voidheart Codex.

42:42.800 --> 42:44.570
You killed our parents

42:45.280 --> 42:47.410
and destroyed the entire Xiao family!

42:50.720 --> 42:51.930
Tell me,

42:52.640 --> 42:53.720
why?

42:54.130 --> 42:55.320
Why?

42:56.860 --> 42:58.980
Why did you do that?

43:04.940 --> 43:05.860
Why?

43:07.040 --> 43:07.560
Father.

43:08.530 --> 43:09.090
Mother.

43:09.530 --> 43:10.660
You're... alright?

43:10.930 --> 43:12.530
Where are Yiren and Qiushui?

43:12.720 --> 43:14.970
They'll be here soon

43:15.280 --> 43:16.810
with the branch disciples.

43:17.210 --> 43:19.860
I can't believe Qiushui actually did it.

43:21.270 --> 43:23.000
He did it. He did it.

43:25.050 --> 43:26.090
Why?

43:27.280 --> 43:29.740
You were the most favored
in the Xiao family.

43:31.280 --> 43:34.340
You always encounter
good fortune and opportunities.

43:35.800 --> 43:37.530
Of course you don't know why!

43:41.200 --> 43:42.130
I, Xiao Kaiyan,

43:43.040 --> 43:45.670
rely on my own efforts
to change my own destiny.

43:46.720 --> 43:47.490
This time,

43:47.840 --> 43:49.160
I will take back everything!
